{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The firm's classification as a licensed firm is supplied as an assessed fact using the categories in the circular.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The specific launch and blackout provisions qualify the general effective-date wording: the post-launch channel test is not applied to the portion of 2 February 2026 before 9:00am.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Each assessment identifies one submission event and its actual method. Multiple submission attempts are assessed separately.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Footnote 3 requires an applicable Hongkong Post e-Cert for XML and prescribed-PDF submissions. For this proposal, the certificate fact records an e-Cert made available for the particular submission; the source alone does not establish signing, authentication or attachment mechanics.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.a9c7e7d0e802f5a3fdf2abc2.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The result covers only the selected channel, method and e-Cert conditions. It does not assess XML-schema conformity, technical testing, reporting deadlines, substantive STR adequacy or overall legal compliance.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"5a662bc0b96d251f733ac6f89032745e1e558323d0638807cc0938bf1f6784f0","candidate_id":"candidate.dedf47c92eb246bdb3947d8156ff1293","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, the result answers whether this individual submission event satisfies the selected STREAMS 2 channel, listed submission-method and footnote 3 e-Cert conditions under the stated certificate assumption. True means the event used STREAMS 2 and either used XML with the required e-Cert, uploaded a completed prescribed PDF form with the required e-Cert, or completed the STREAMS 2 web-based STR form. False means at least one of these selected conditions failed. A false or unknown scope produces no compliance judgment, and unknown input facts must not be treated as false. This is a proposed limited model, not legal approval.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.415b101fa14440279ea0b209de7cfba2","issue.78da73f5677d4d85adad69e7e4297ffe","issue.16099acdac0f4717bb8d147acdbe0103","issue.c8659a5e0c644d75871302a96aa84ebc","issue.2fb8103d6d1344af9f9785f8c2eb9909"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"Channel, document format, form completion and submission-specific certificate provision are separate facts. A single Boolean such as submitted_electronically would conceal both an XML or PDF submission outside STREAMS 2 and the absence of an e-Cert for those methods. Calendar-date-only scope would also wrongly extend the channel rule into the pre-launch blackout on 2 February.","run_id":"run.f9cab12e5709452f9b6e3121495ab6bf","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"71c3627a60fbdf7e662cc30b3dae7b8ff95e13a67ad5eade35f0a35874e23663","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Post-launch STR channel, submission-method and footnote 3 conditions"}